#: ../../source/docs/modules/movinghome.rst:5 009a2dac225a4f478b5fe52eb22fc6ae
msgid "Movinghome"
msgstr "Movinghome"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/movinghome.rst:7 e96586584b3c48ca9fcd7d9b267f04f8
msgid ""
"Allows changing vehicle's home position to new GCS location, if the GCS "
"position moves. Requires NMEA GPS attached to serial port of GCS."
msgstr "当地面站位置移动时，允许将飞行器 home 点更新为新的地面站位置。需要连接 NMEA GPS 至地面站串口。"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/movinghome.rst:14
#: e8b9285522a043b793a2ab7ad6aba5f0
msgid "Usage"
msgstr "使用方法"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/movinghome.rst:16
#: 0c6f341bdd5d42bb88a7e7aa9d0a85a4
msgid "movinghome <status|on|off|radius|device|baud>"
msgstr "movinghome <status|on|off|radius|device|baud>"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/movinghome.rst:18
#: fff99ec33ba344e9a8b687c62aee2c25
msgid ""
"on: enable position updates as GCS moves. If GSC moves beyond threshold, "
"vehicle home will be updated to current GCS position."
msgstr "on：启用随地面站移动的位置更新。若地面站移动超过阈值，飞行器 home 点将更新为当前地面站位置。"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/movinghome.rst:19
#: 1a226a0786f94fdf98b0abb8b591d56b
msgid "off: disable home position updating"
msgstr "off：禁用 home 点位置更新"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/movinghome.rst:20
#: 5032a3af181345a7b86a307294ca44f4
msgid ""
"radius: threshold in meters that GCS must move to update home in vehicle."
msgstr "radius：地面站需移动多少米才触发飞行器 home 点更新（单位：米）。"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/movinghome.rst:21
#: fe37b60889bc4deba7294d9482fe4408
msgid "status: status report"
msgstr "status：状态报告"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/movinghome.rst:22
#: 7a8e5db86af34abeb6cc6df64c5c86f7
msgid "baud: baudrate of serial port which is connected to NMEA GPS"
msgstr "baud：连接 NMEA GPS 的串口波特率"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/movinghome.rst:23
#: 12034f724c4e4307b5f0d65136f1f0ff
msgid "device: name of serial port which is connected NMEA GPS"
msgstr "device：连接 NMEA GPS 的串口名称"
